<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   40.60		 40.65</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	63.20		 63.30</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 26.75		 26.80</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.371		 0.373</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.80		 10.82</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.03		 11.05</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.07		  1.09</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 9.50 pct	    9.80 pct</p>
</text>
